  "historical_measurements": "The remaining sections record the original strict-metric experiment before #71 landed. Its five-field fuzzy sensitivity uses the earlier null-inclusive scoring rules.",
  "product_commit": "5741d66d48f81bd601dcabc5d25e254234d9fe55",
  "base": "f7f3ee9",
  "model": "ministral-3b-2512",
  "profile": "README regional RL, spans, supported routing, incomplete gaps, charge focus, dual OCR disabled",
  "definitions": {
    "local": "Keyless CLI with the development inventories.",
    "control": "Documented keyed profile before the selector. For triggered documents the original engine chain is replayed from the saved pre-selector rule record with the selector bypassed. General model replies are reused only for identical schema, instructions and prompt. Non-triggered outputs are shared.",
    "merged": "Live selector within the documented keyed profile on the same development documents.",
    "fuzzy": "Strict null-inclusive evals.metrics with one-to-one normalized Levenshtein >=0.80 credit on the five eligible long-string fields. Fuzzy sensitivity only.",
    "timing": "Per-document service seconds in a contended development run, including OCR and model requests. Control subtracts measured selector request and replay durations. The coordinator reserved quiet 150-PDF timing for the integrated system. These service times cannot be summed to give parallel wall time.",
    "paired_fields": "Field counts compare values within the same PDF. fixed and broken count changes in normalized matched leaves. Populated substitution and retention counts use singleton paths with one prediction and one reference. Request seconds are counted once per block.",
    "residual": "Unmatched reference leaves grouped by whether a competing prediction is present, null, against a gold null, or missing entirely."
  },
  "iterations": [
    "A first-page party-name pilot made four live choices on corpus 1. One completed a branch name and three incorporated mailing text. Name expansions now require a printed legal form or identifying unit.",
    "The purchase-title collector addresses role confusion between a procurement and a named project inside its subject. Only one bounded cover span containing exactly the current project name is eligible. Two of the three corrected titles were related development examples.",
    "The payment selector found no supported amount or date replacements in the final development inventories. No attempt to synthesize an unreadable amount was made."
  ],
